          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What's the most affordable structural panel material for a new house in India?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Standard flat or lightly profiled aluminium sheet cladding with a powder coat finish offers the best balance of cost, durability, and appearance for most residential projects across India."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Does using a cheaper material save more than simplifying the design?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Generally no. Panel complexity, how many unique shapes and how intricate the pattern is, affects cost more than base material choice, making design simplification the more effective first step for controlling budget."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Should I use a premium finish across my entire house facade?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Not necessarily. Reserving a higher grade finish for elevations facing the harshest sun exposure, typically west facing walls, while using standard powder coating elsewhere, controls cost while still protecting the areas that need it most."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Is it cheaper to mix materials or use one material throughout?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Strategically mixing an economical primary material with a small amount of premium accent material, like stone at the entrance, is typically more cost effective and visually richer than using one premium material across the entire facade."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What should I prioritise if my facade budget is very limited?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Prioritise correct substructure engineering and waterproofing over pattern complexity, since these hidden layers determine long-term performance, while visual complexity can be simplified without compromising durability."
          }
        }
